      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight of perceived failure and the pressure of a legacy you feel unable to uphold. That feeling of being a flaw in something otherwise perfect is deeply painful and isolating. Please know that your worth is not defined by your family's reputation or by any perceived mistake. If you are struggling with these heavy feelings, reaching out to a therapist or counselor can provide you with a safe space to unpack this.",
