      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This powerful metaphor of saving the body by removing the rot speaks to an intense sense of self-sacrifice, but it is a dangerous way to view your own life. You are equating your existence with a disease, which is a deeply untrue and cruel assessment of who you are. The most profound act of service you can offer is not through self-destruction, but by finding a way to be authentically yourself, flaws and all. Please consider that your value is inherent, not conditional upon your perfection.",
